        "$\\frac{y'}{y} = \\cos x \\ln x + \\frac{\\sin x}{x}$。",
        "乘回 $y$：$y' = x^{\\sin x}(\\cos x \\ln x + \\frac{\\sin x}{x})$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$x^{\\sin x}(\\cos x \\ln x + \\frac{\\sin x}{x})$",
      "claim": "D(x^(sin(x))) == x^(sin(x))*(cos(x)*ln(x)+sin(x)/x)"
    },
