      "problemId": "lec-03-q2c",
      "steps": [
        "$x > 1$ 時每個因式都是正的，可以直接取 $\\ln$：$\\ln y = 2 \\ln x + \\frac{1}{2} \\ln(x + 1) - 3 \\ln(x - 1)$。",
        "逐項微分：$\\frac{y'}{y} = \\frac{2}{x} + \\frac{1}{2(x + 1)} - \\frac{3}{x - 1}$。",
        "乘回 $y$：$y' = [x^2 \\frac{\\sqrt{x + 1}}{(x - 1)^3}] \\cdot (\\frac{2}{x} + \\frac{1}{2(x + 1)} - \\frac{3}{x - 1})$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$x^2 \\frac{\\sqrt{x + 1}}{(x - 1)^3} \\cdot (\\frac{2}{x} + \\frac{1}{2(x + 1)} - \\frac{3}{x - 1})$",
